                                                "sense_id": "034afdb5-05b4-38d4-b5a2-8fdee4c25156",
                                                "text": "Thus, regimental commands in the army were – as with the judiciary or the financial bureaucracy – venal posts, which were purchased, bequeathed and sold among the nobility."
